<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Samsonite rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Samsonite rated a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it initiated coverage of Samsonite Corp with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3-1/4 to 46 in late morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
<p>-- This morning, the company said it priced a 8.6 million share offering at $42 per share.</p>
<p>-- Trading in the shares was very brisk, with volume of almost 4 million shares at 1200 EST.</p>
</text>
